1
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:17,520
Aiming for the sunset
floating over the Nakagawa,

2
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:24,660
kick a pebble and even your shoes fly off.

3
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:33,020
Did I save up my money, I wonder?

4
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:39,140
They laughed because
I'm still a kid at heart.

5
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:44,220
Even if I drop my energy somewhere,

6
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:49,280
Pachinko, Kameari,
one yawn, nothing changes.

7
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:53,180
The streetscape feels strangely gentle.

8
00:00:54,660 --> 00:01:01,120
From the pointed hat's water flask,

9
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:07,440
the sunset falls toward
the great gate of heaven.

10
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:15,920
Tomorrow, too,
somehow it's ending, isn't it.

11
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:21,020
Katsushika Shibamata, happiness too, lost.

12
00:01:21,020 --> 00:01:24,520
Because I'm a fool who only realized it now.

13
00:01:53,960 --> 00:01:54,880
Saori!

14
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:57,280
Toucher!

15
00:02:14,380 --> 00:02:17,820
Saori's Chibu-san is this close,

16
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:22,700
how happy I am!

17
00:02:23,420 --> 00:02:24,500
Sensō-ji!

18
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:26,880
Sensō-ji!

19
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:28,380
Sensō-ji!

20
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:30,960
Run away quickly!

21
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,960
What is that guy saying?

22
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:35,780
In this situation,
running away would be a waste, wouldn't it?

23
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,620
Hey, Saori.

24
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,900
Pin for an ippon!

25
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:47,780
That's it!

26
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:49,160
Yay!

27
00:02:49,620 --> 00:02:51,280
We beat Mr. Sakon!

28
00:02:52,820 --> 00:02:54,840
I ended up cheering in a man's chest.

29
00:02:56,900 --> 00:02:57,280
With this...

30
00:02:57,280 --> 00:03:00,620
W-with this, that's five losses in a row,
even if it was only a practice match.

31
00:03:01,420 --> 00:03:04,400
What on earth happened to Sakonji?

32
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:07,240
Ryotsu, do you have any idea?

33
00:03:07,580 --> 00:03:11,620
That idiot was thinking about
Saori from Tokimemo during the match!

34
00:03:12,160 --> 00:03:14,040
What's this "Dokimemo" thing?

35
00:03:14,380 --> 00:03:17,980
You don't mean the dating sim
game Tokimeki Memorial, do you?

36
00:03:17,980 --> 00:03:19,600
You're still playing that?

37
00:03:20,420 --> 00:03:24,600
Buying up every Tokimemo item there is: CDs,
posters, fancy goods.

38
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:26,480
He's completely hooked,
right down to the marrow.

39
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:29,380
Sakonji is no longer a martial artist.

40
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:32,520
That guy is now a super-grade Memorialist.

41
00:03:33,260 --> 00:03:34,140
You've got to be kidding.

42
00:03:34,140 --> 00:03:36,160
The nationals are next month, you know!

43
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:38,220
Everyone's counting on you to win the title.

44
00:03:38,220 --> 00:03:40,580
Are you really going to waste
your time on a game like that?

45
00:03:40,580 --> 00:03:42,660
Don't take it out on me.

46
00:03:42,660 --> 00:03:45,300
Once you're hooked, you're hooked.
There's nothing to be done about it.

47
00:03:46,300 --> 00:03:49,400
Well, let's give up on this one
and hope for the next tournament.

48
00:03:49,820 --> 00:03:52,280
By then he'll probably be
tired of Tokimeki Memorial too.

49
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:54,300
So you're the one who got him into it

50
00:03:54,640 --> 00:03:55,282
Ryotsu,

51
00:03:55,332 --> 00:03:59,210
get Sakon away from that
Tokimeki-whatever game right away

52
00:03:59,260 --> 00:04:01,500
so he can focus on judo.

53
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:05,340
If Sakon doesn't win the tournament,

54
00:04:05,390 --> 00:04:07,540
you won't get any paid leave or bonus.

55
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,500
How did it come to that?

56
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,580
Because it's your responsibility.

57
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:12,160
No way.

58
00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:14,820
W-wait a minute.

59
00:04:15,420 --> 00:04:19,020
Ugh, shut up.
My paid leave and bonus are on the line too!

60
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:20,840
Please, stop.

61
00:04:21,460 --> 00:04:22,480
I'll die, I'll die.

62
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:28,320
S-sorry. You were trying to take my Saori, so I...
I got carried away with the force.

63
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:29,700
Saori is mine.

64
00:04:30,460 --> 00:04:33,600
Didn't you say it was your younger
brother who got hooked on Tokimeki Memorial?

65
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:37,065
That's right.

66
00:04:37,115 --> 00:04:40,960
Every time my brother visits, he forgets it when he goes home.
What a pain.

67
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:44,618
I see. Then your brother
must be having trouble too.

68
00:04:44,668 --> 00:04:46,580
I'll take it back to him.

69
00:04:47,140 --> 00:04:47,920
Wait!

70
00:04:49,340 --> 00:04:50,980
Do you want to get charged with murder?!

71
00:04:51,660 --> 00:04:52,540
S-sorry.

72
00:04:52,540 --> 00:04:55,380
Anyway,
I'll keep this at the police box for now.

73
00:04:55,380 --> 00:04:57,480
Tell your brother to come pick it up.

74
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:00,000
No way...

75
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:05,580
What do I do, Saori?

76
00:05:08,180 --> 00:05:08,820
Your...

77
00:05:10,620 --> 00:05:12,560
Life without you,

78
00:05:15,220 --> 00:05:16,840
I can't imagine it.

79
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:20,980
Bosch.

80
00:05:24,100 --> 00:05:25,980
That was the last Saori.

81
00:05:28,060 --> 00:05:29,200
Saori!

82
00:05:30,180 --> 00:05:31,340
Saori!

83
00:05:31,340 --> 00:05:33,460
Saori!

84
00:05:39,822 --> 00:05:44,440
Little brats

85
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:47,040
Even if we think we can
outrun that big Honda,

86
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,240
Damn it

87
00:05:48,880 --> 00:05:49,400
Whoa!

88
00:05:51,780 --> 00:05:57,666
Whoa,

89
00:05:57,716 --> 00:06:06,620
That was close

90
00:06:07,100 --> 00:06:10,660
But that's definitely Mr. Sakon

91
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:14,360
Strange, something's up here

92
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:17,760
Hey you, got some new moves up your sleeve?

93
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,780
Go for it!

94
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:28,060
Saori! Where are you, Saori?

95
00:06:29,220 --> 00:06:29,580
What?

96
00:06:31,200 --> 00:06:33,180
No way, you're joking, right?

97
00:06:33,180 --> 00:06:34,520
I'm serious!

98
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:38,800
Saori, Saori... he was a textbook
case of Tokimeki Memorial addiction.

99
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:42,980
Just because they took a game goodie away,
he's gone this far?

100
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:48,660
But if it's true...

101
00:06:49,580 --> 00:06:52,960
If Sakon doesn't win,
my paid leave and bonus too...

102
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:55,960
Unexpected!

103
00:06:56,880 --> 00:06:58,460
Honda, lead the way.

104
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:05,860
Sa-sa-sa-sa-sa-sa-sa...

105
00:07:05,860 --> 00:07:08,900
If you're making this up, you'll pay for it.

106
00:07:08,900 --> 00:07:11,280
No way, look, Senpai!

107
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:13,698
Sakon, look!

108
00:07:13,748 --> 00:07:15,600
What do you mean, Tokimeki disease?

109
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:17,080
Just go with your gut like always!

110
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:24,420
Eeeeeeh!

111
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:40,180
Let's share our heart-pounding
memories together,

112
00:07:40,180 --> 00:07:41,860
together

113
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:45,860
What is this creepy song, senpai?

114
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:49,620
This is the opening
theme of Tokimeki Memorial.

115
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:52,740
Don't tell me you disobeyed
my orders and bought it anyway!

116
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,100
Sakonji, you!

117
00:07:58,300 --> 00:08:00,720
April 9th, before the visit

118
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:03,240
If I wait here, I'll get to see Saori.

119
00:08:06,440 --> 00:08:08,200
Senpai, what does this mean?

120
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:10,660
Even though there's nothing on the screen,
he's acting like that.

121
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:12,400
It's withdrawal symptoms.

122
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:16,500
This isn't good.

123
00:08:16,500 --> 00:08:18,220
Other characters are going to show up.

124
00:08:19,620 --> 00:08:20,600
They can't come out, can they?

125
00:08:22,260 --> 00:08:22,900
N-no, that's not it!

126
00:08:23,060 --> 00:08:25,780
Sakonji, we're not game characters!

127
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:27,260
Hey, snap out of it!

128
00:08:27,740 --> 00:08:29,520
S-sorry!

129
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:39,640
So, this withdrawal has
been going on all this time?

130
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:43,320
Yes, for my health, my leave, and my bonus,

131
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:45,200
I'd like him to get better somehow.

132
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:48,180
You're not saying it's
for Mr. Sakon's sake, then.

133
00:08:48,180 --> 00:08:49,040
Of course not.

134
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:52,080
But he did throw his senior around, so...

135
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:54,900
Once the match starts,
his body will remember what to do.

136
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:59,300
Come on, you have to behave yourself, Saori.

137
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:02,700
Saori? W-where? Where is she?

138
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:08,340
Pull yourself together.

139
00:09:08,340 --> 00:09:09,680
But Mom!

140
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,040
Saori

141
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:14,080
Sensei, are you okay?

142
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:15,640
Sakon-sensei

143
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:21,340
I don't remember, not at all.

144
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,200
You've got to be kidding!

145
00:09:24,180 --> 00:09:25,860
Come here for a sec, Sakon.

146
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:28,620
What? Are you going to let me see Saori?

147
00:09:29,520 --> 00:09:31,804
Wrong! We're going to train deep in the mountains,
far away from people,

148
00:09:31,854 --> 00:09:33,800
and make you forget all about Saori!

149
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,260
No way!

150
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,620
So you still remember her after all?

151
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,220
Stop agonizing, hey!

152
00:09:44,780 --> 00:09:47,690
Forget Saori? How could I
Translation>
possibly forget Saori?

153
00:09:47,740 --> 00:09:49,220
I'd rather die!

154
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:53,120
Did you find him?

155
00:09:53,180 --> 00:09:53,500
No.

156
00:09:54,100 --> 00:09:55,920
Damn it, where on earth did he go?

157
00:09:56,140 --> 00:09:57,220
There he is!

158
00:09:57,920 --> 00:10:00,220
Senpai, he went right inside.

159
00:10:00,220 --> 00:10:01,720
Wait, that shop is...

160
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,840
Oh no, this is bad!

161
00:10:04,740 --> 00:10:06,060
So this is where you were.

162
00:10:08,060 --> 00:10:11,460
I believe a 1/6 scale Saori figure
was supposed to arrive here today.

163
00:10:11,460 --> 00:10:13,380
Such a naughty boy.

164
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:15,740
Naughty boys like you get poked!

165
00:10:24,260 --> 00:10:25,160
Aaaaaaah!

166
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:25,780
Aaaaaaah!

167
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:33,440
Aaaaaaah! Listen!

168
00:10:34,160 --> 00:10:36,060
Give me my Saori, old man!

169
00:10:40,020 --> 00:10:43,440
Get off me, Sakon!
What are you babbling about, old man?

170
00:10:46,380 --> 00:10:48,920
Don't run away!
You were trying to buy Saori!

171
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:49,760
Saori?

172
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:52,700
That's the thing your
brother's so hooked on, right?

173
00:10:52,700 --> 00:10:54,740
That's it. He's trying to play dumb.

174
00:10:54,740 --> 00:10:57,040
Then why did he come into this game shop?

175
00:10:58,260 --> 00:11:00,020
No, he's been like this lately, hasn't he?

176
00:11:00,020 --> 00:11:03,520
I thought I'd try building
one for a change of pace.

177
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:05,540
Here you go, sir.

178
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:06,940
You're lucky.

179
00:11:06,940 --> 00:11:08,840
This is my final move.

180
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:11,880
Get this one for me too while you're at it.

181
00:11:11,880 --> 00:11:12,660
Y-yes.

182
00:11:12,660 --> 00:11:13,931
Hey, Sakonji,

183
00:11:13,981 --> 00:11:17,120
Are you really interested in model kits?

184
00:11:17,660 --> 00:11:21,320
Of course I am. Even you must have
built plenty when you were a kid.

185
00:11:23,740 --> 00:11:26,540
Looks like he's gone back to being his usual self,
Sakonji-san.

186
00:11:27,100 --> 00:11:28,240
I hope so.

187
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:33,580
That comes to 85,350 yen in total.

188
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:37,200
They're all limited editions, you know.
Want to back out?

189
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:41,000
Gakan, wrap them up for me.

190
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:46,520
Well, Saori has finally come back to me.

191
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:50,400
I'm gonna poke it, poke, poke!

192
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:52,220
Whoa!

193
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:53,900
What is this?!

194
00:11:56,940 --> 00:11:58,500
Sao, Sao...

195
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:01,200
Saoriii!

196
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:05,200
That's because you don't know
what's going on inside the figure.

197
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:06,780
Well, should we confiscate it?

198
00:12:08,180 --> 00:12:12,500
Wait, when we saw the figures at the model shop earlier,
he was back to normal, right?

199
00:12:15,380 --> 00:12:17,520
This could be useful.

200
00:12:17,860 --> 00:12:18,680
Saoriii.

201
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:36,620
Ohara-kun

202
00:12:37,420 --> 00:12:39,720
Today's practice match will be fine, right?

203
00:12:40,380 --> 00:12:43,580
Surely Sakon-kun hasn't lost six in a row?

204
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:46,260
We've taken some precautions, at least.

205
00:12:46,880 --> 00:12:50,180
I wonder if Ryotsu is really
keeping him away from Sakon.

206
00:12:53,260 --> 00:12:54,060
Saori!

207
00:12:58,560 --> 00:12:59,540
Sakonji!

208
00:12:59,540 --> 00:13:02,000
Ryotsu!

209
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:04,640
What's wrong?
You look like you're in a lot of pain.

210
00:13:05,140 --> 00:13:06,020
It's nothing.

211
00:13:06,020 --> 00:13:07,860
Go away.

212
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:09,060
I see.

213
00:13:09,060 --> 00:13:11,940
And I even brought a gift to celebrate.

214
00:13:16,300 --> 00:13:17,100
What's this?

215
00:13:17,100 --> 00:13:17,380
What?

216
00:13:21,500 --> 00:13:22,820
S-Sakon...

217
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:24,500
Saoriii!

218
00:13:31,560 --> 00:13:34,560
Calm down! I'll let you touch her now.

219
00:13:36,380 --> 00:13:37,880
G-go on, grab her!

220
00:13:39,780 --> 00:13:42,020
Just for a moment. Don't go overboard.

221
00:13:42,020 --> 00:13:43,660
I know, I know.

222
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:58,880
Calmed down now?

223
00:13:58,880 --> 00:14:00,020
Calmed down.

224
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:03,720
Alright, Sakon,
let's make a deal here, got it?

225
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:07,300
If you win this match,
I'll give you this figure.

226
00:14:09,220 --> 00:14:10,680
Wait, don't apologize.

227
00:14:11,060 --> 00:14:13,140
This is only if you win the match.

228
00:14:13,780 --> 00:14:15,720
Once I win the match, Saori will be mine -

229
00:14:17,100 --> 00:14:17,800
all mine!

230
00:14:21,140 --> 00:14:22,520
Even in Japan, yeah!

231
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:29,620
Aaaaah! A win! The losing streak is over!
With this, we're safe for the nationals

232
00:14:30,460 --> 00:14:32,620
Didn't expect it to go this smoothly.

233
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:35,540
Aaaaah!

234
00:14:35,540 --> 00:14:39,380
Aaaaah!

235
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:46,400
H-hey, I got thrown!

236
00:14:46,400 --> 00:14:47,660
H-hey, what are you talking about, Reiko?

237
00:14:47,660 --> 00:14:50,740
As if I'd seriously get thrown
by an elementary schooler!

238
00:14:51,300 --> 00:14:52,840
But it was so beautifully

239
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:54,620
done. I was teaching him the move.

240
00:14:54,620 --> 00:14:55,440
Honestly...

241
00:14:56,400 --> 00:14:57,400
Hey, Sakonji.

242
00:14:58,220 --> 00:14:59,200
Saoriii!

243
00:15:00,600 --> 00:15:02,400
Uh-oh, he's having withdrawal symptoms.

244
00:15:02,400 --> 00:15:04,080
If the Chief finds out,
we're in big trouble.

245
00:15:06,020 --> 00:15:07,820
Alright, that's it for practice today.

246
00:15:09,380 --> 00:15:11,034
Look, Sakonji, it's Saori.

247
00:15:11,084 --> 00:15:14,100
Go ahead and poke her like you always do.
Come on, come on.

248
00:15:14,260 --> 00:15:16,980
Ah-ah, S-Saori.

249
00:15:20,520 --> 00:15:21,680
Kikki kikii.

250
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:22,500
There, there.

251
00:15:22,820 --> 00:15:23,280
It's not working!

252
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:25,060
What?!

253
00:15:26,160 --> 00:15:29,980
No way. Touch it more.
Come on, come on, come on.

254
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:31,760
It's no good.

255
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:34,387
D-could it be,

256
00:15:34,437 --> 00:15:37,840
has he grown bored of the same
figures and lost his thrill?

257
00:15:39,900 --> 00:15:41,560
A different Saori figure?

258
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:43,020
We have one.

259
00:15:43,020 --> 00:15:43,580
Really?!

260
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:45,620
One that just came in today.

261
00:15:47,540 --> 00:15:49,740
It's a one-third scale figure of Saori.

262
00:15:50,460 --> 00:15:52,520
It's over fifty centimeters tall.

263
00:15:53,060 --> 00:15:53,940
Yes! I won!

264
00:15:57,400 --> 00:15:59,800
Tch, idiot! Don't shout so loud!

265
00:15:59,880 --> 00:16:01,720
Is it really okay, Ryotsu?
Is it really okay?

266
00:16:01,900 --> 00:16:03,620
Just hurry up and poke it!

267
00:16:05,500 --> 00:16:05,980
Poke!

268
00:16:06,680 --> 00:16:07,220
Aah!

269
00:16:09,920 --> 00:16:11,200
Did you hear that?

270
00:16:14,460 --> 00:16:16,580
Hear it? That's an understatement.

271
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:36,960
Already ran out?

272
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,440
You're touching it way too much!

273
00:16:39,380 --> 00:16:43,420
Aaaah! They're releasing a life-size figure!

274
00:16:43,920 --> 00:16:50,820
Really? Regular stores don't have room for it, so it's mail-order only.
What do we do? Obviously, we order right away!

275
00:16:59,120 --> 00:17:01,220
Just wait, it'll be here soon.

276
00:17:01,820 --> 00:17:03,580
Yocchi-san, you have a delivery!

277
00:17:03,580 --> 00:17:06,200
It's here... wow, it's really big.

278
00:17:08,340 --> 00:17:12,120
Rejoice, Sakonji! It's already painted,
so you can touch it as soon as you open it!

279
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:15,340
Hey, we only ordered one!

280
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:19,440
No, I asked the manufacturer,
and they said there are ten types in total.

281
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:22,040
What should we do?

282
00:17:23,180 --> 00:17:26,800
Oh well, we'll make Sakonji pay
back the big money later anyway.

283
00:17:27,280 --> 00:17:30,180
Hey, hurry and hold him down!

284
00:17:30,180 --> 00:17:30,600
Got it.

285
00:17:32,180 --> 00:17:34,020
Saori!

286
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:36,800
Go ahead, you can touch it.

287
00:17:36,800 --> 00:17:38,820
Saori!

288
00:17:43,720 --> 00:17:46,339
Chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi,
chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi...

289
00:17:46,389 --> 00:17:49,263
Chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi,
chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi...

290
00:17:49,313 --> 00:17:52,163
Chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi,
chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi...

291
00:17:52,213 --> 00:17:55,113
Chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi,
chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi...

292
00:17:55,163 --> 00:17:58,001
Chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi,
chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi...

293
00:17:58,051 --> 00:18:00,939
Chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi,
chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi...

294
00:18:00,989 --> 00:18:03,852
Chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi,
chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi...

295
00:18:03,902 --> 00:18:06,920
Chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi,
chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi, chi...

296
00:18:06,920 --> 00:18:08,180
He'll hold out until the tournament, right?

297
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:13,500
Is Ryotsu here?

298
00:18:14,220 --> 00:18:15,520
What is it, Chief?

299
00:18:15,520 --> 00:18:16,680
Don't "what is it" me.

300
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:20,200
I hear Sakonji has been skipping practice all this time,
haven't you?

301
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:20,800
Yeah.

302
00:18:21,660 --> 00:18:23,840
The judo match is tomorrow, right?

303
00:18:23,840 --> 00:18:24,960
S-senpai

304
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:26,260
I don't know anything about it.

305
00:18:26,600 --> 00:18:27,120
Ryotsu!

306
00:18:27,580 --> 00:18:29,440
You defied my orders and

307
00:18:29,440 --> 00:18:32,480
you didn't confiscate his pottery-whatsit goods,
did you?

308
00:18:32,480 --> 00:18:33,860
I'd never do something like that.

309
00:18:33,860 --> 00:18:36,780
My paid leave and bonus are on the line too,
you know.

310
00:18:36,780 --> 00:18:39,480
R-right, that's right.

311
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:42,960
Honestly, Sakonji. Don't tell me
he's already stopped asking for her.

312
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:47,300
Sakonji!

313
00:18:52,300 --> 00:18:54,460
Ryotsu-kun, welcome.

314
00:18:54,980 --> 00:18:56,740
What are you doing, you,

315
00:18:56,790 --> 00:18:59,260
What about practice?
The tournament is tomorrow!

316
00:18:59,260 --> 00:19:02,180
Practice? Tournament?
What are you talking about?

317
00:19:04,100 --> 00:19:05,440
Judo. Judo!

318
00:19:05,820 --> 00:19:07,800
Judo that one.

319
00:19:07,800 --> 00:19:08,880
Don't "that one" me!

320
00:19:09,320 --> 00:19:10,300
Drinking until morning,

321
00:19:11,720 --> 00:19:13,140
and stark naked.

322
00:19:13,140 --> 00:19:14,480
You're terrible, you know that?

323
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:16,060
I'm wearing underwear, though.

324
00:19:16,060 --> 00:19:17,680
That's not the point!

325
00:19:18,280 --> 00:19:20,280
Hurry up and go to the dojo.

326
00:19:20,280 --> 00:19:22,100
Chief Ohara is getting suspicious of you.

327
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:22,960
No way.

328
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:23,600
What?

329
00:19:24,220 --> 00:19:27,860
I'm going to live in this room
with Saori and the others forever!

330
00:19:29,080 --> 00:19:29,800
Oh no.

331
00:19:29,800 --> 00:19:31,860
Because you stimulated him all at once,

332
00:19:33,860 --> 00:19:34,340
Oh no.

333
00:19:37,100 --> 00:19:42,320
No, it's worse than before. The chief is sniffing around,
and if the figures

334
00:19:42,320 --> 00:19:45,180
get found, they'll all be confiscated!

335
00:19:46,060 --> 00:19:48,800
Right, Saori's going to
disappear from this room!

336
00:19:49,940 --> 00:19:55,960
I can't stand being separated from her!
So hide them quickly!

337
00:19:57,700 --> 00:19:59,100
For now, into the closet.

338
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:03,920
Even if we take out the futons,
I guess we can only fit about five.

339
00:20:04,720 --> 00:20:07,060
Oh well, I'll hide the rest in my room.

340
00:20:08,360 --> 00:20:10,940
No, no, don't take them out of this room!

341
00:20:11,800 --> 00:20:13,980
You're changing your character way too much!

342
00:20:14,500 --> 00:20:17,100
Alright, stop crying.
I'll hide them somehow.

343
00:20:18,220 --> 00:20:19,760
First, let's stash some under the sink.

344
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:21,520
That smile is creepy.

345
00:20:22,080 --> 00:20:23,600
Sorry, Saori... goodbye.

346
00:20:23,600 --> 00:20:27,560
Now, for the other four, let's take
them apart and hide them in the fridge.

347
00:20:30,360 --> 00:20:34,040
Got it! Think of another way...

348
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:37,540
Only place left is inside the punching bag

349
00:20:37,540 --> 00:20:38,740
This is awful.

350
00:20:39,320 --> 00:20:41,580
Next, let's brace that
shoji screen over here.

351
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:44,300
Are we supposed to be hiding them?

352
00:20:44,760 --> 00:20:46,340
We can't afford to be picky right now.

353
00:20:47,240 --> 00:20:48,720
Now, the other two...

354
00:20:50,800 --> 00:20:53,220
This is Ohara. Sakonji, you got a minute?

355
00:20:53,220 --> 00:20:54,920
What's going on, Ryotsu?

356
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:57,800
I don't know!
I didn't hear the Chief was coming either!

357
00:20:57,800 --> 00:21:00,280
For now, cram one of them into the closet.

358
00:21:00,280 --> 00:21:01,580
And the other one...

359
00:21:02,060 --> 00:21:02,940
Are there none?

360
00:21:05,020 --> 00:21:06,040
Excuse me.

361
00:21:06,420 --> 00:21:06,860
Chief!

362
00:21:06,860 --> 00:21:09,120
Chief, are you here to visit him?

363
00:21:09,580 --> 00:21:11,520
Visit? Did he get injured or something?

364
00:21:11,520 --> 00:21:13,020
It's just a cold.

365
00:21:13,400 --> 00:21:15,740
The judo tournament is tomorrow, you know!

366
00:21:16,580 --> 00:21:18,020
Are you all right, Sakonji?

367
00:21:18,020 --> 00:21:19,180
Well, sort of.

368
00:21:21,060 --> 00:21:23,080
Saori's... my nipple...

369
00:21:24,080 --> 00:21:25,800
He seems to have quite a fever.

370
00:21:27,800 --> 00:21:28,620
It's brand new, you know.

371
00:21:28,620 --> 00:21:29,260
I see.

372
00:21:30,440 --> 00:21:30,980
Ryotsu.

373
00:21:30,980 --> 00:21:31,300
Yes.

374
00:21:31,780 --> 00:21:33,340
You're not very considerate, are you?

375
00:21:33,340 --> 00:21:36,160
In a cold room like this,
even a cold won't get better.

376
00:21:36,160 --> 00:21:37,360
Couldn't you at least turn on the heater?

377
00:21:37,360 --> 00:21:37,860
Yes.

378
00:21:41,540 --> 00:21:43,900
Then, Chief, please leave the rest to me.

379
00:21:44,360 --> 00:21:44,820
I see.

380
00:21:44,820 --> 00:21:47,720
Then get well soon, Sakonji.

381
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:48,000
Yes.

382
00:21:52,140 --> 00:21:53,780
Hey, Sakonji, that's enough now.

383
00:21:53,780 --> 00:21:55,840
Hehehehehe.

384
00:21:56,280 --> 00:21:58,040
Ugh, what a hopeless guy. Wake up!

385
00:21:58,760 --> 00:22:01,000
Go get some fresh air
outside and cool your head.

386
00:22:14,280 --> 00:22:15,540
So you finally came to.

387
00:22:15,540 --> 00:22:16,840
She's calling.

388
00:22:17,420 --> 00:22:18,200
Saori's...

389
00:22:18,700 --> 00:22:20,360
Saori and the others are calling.

390
00:22:21,440 --> 00:22:22,100
Saori.

391
00:22:24,820 --> 00:22:26,060
What's wrong? All of a sudden.

392
00:22:32,560 --> 00:22:34,320
But stop! Do you want to die?!

393
00:22:34,460 --> 00:22:35,620
Saori!

394
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:37,860
There's still someone in there?

395
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:39,220
Saori No. 2!

396
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:43,300
No. 3, No. 4, No. 5...

397
00:22:46,740 --> 00:22:48,820
There's no way he'll make tomorrow's match.

398
00:22:48,820 --> 00:22:52,020
Damn it,
my paid leave and bonus are gone too!

399
00:22:52,020 --> 00:22:53,240
No. 6!

400
00:23:04,140 --> 00:23:05,420
No. 7!

401
00:23:06,100 --> 00:23:07,300
No. 8!

402
00:23:08,240 --> 00:23:09,520
No. 9!

403
00:23:10,020 --> 00:23:11,280
No. 10!

404
00:23:12,300 --> 00:23:13,940
Ippon! That's it!

405
00:23:14,380 --> 00:23:15,580
We did it!

406
00:23:15,940 --> 00:23:16,740
We're the champions!

407
00:23:17,060 --> 00:23:19,700
Just as expected, you really
show your strength when it counts!

408
00:23:20,700 --> 00:23:21,560
Well done, Ryotsu!

409
00:23:21,840 --> 00:23:25,380
Well, I knew this would happen
if you just did what I told you.

410
00:23:27,200 --> 00:23:30,640
Thanks to that,
my bonus and paid leave were saved too.

411
00:23:31,260 --> 00:23:33,380
Then why don't you act
a little happier about it?

412
00:23:33,420 --> 00:23:35,980
Look! He's crying from being so moved.

413
00:23:37,740 --> 00:23:40,080
He must have been really happy
about winning this tournament.

414
00:23:40,080 --> 00:23:45,180
I don't know what happens after this,
so don't blame me.

415
00:23:46,020 --> 00:23:47,360
Now that the tournament is over,

416
00:23:47,360 --> 00:23:49,980
where will he explode in anger next?

417
00:23:53,060 --> 00:23:57,900
Give me Saori.

418
00:24:05,880 --> 00:24:07,920
Well, well,
if it isn't Reiji Shiratori again!

419
00:24:08,380 --> 00:24:10,540
But what is that camper van?

420
00:24:10,540 --> 00:24:13,340
You don't understand a single
bit of the joy of camping.

421
00:24:13,800 --> 00:24:16,520
Alright,
I'll teach you what real camping is.

422
00:24:16,520 --> 00:24:20,440
Next time: Burning Camp Soul,
or CAMP-TAMA for short.

423
00:24:20,700 --> 00:24:21,480
See you then!

424
00:25:20,700 --> 00:25:26,520
You know the dazzle, right?

425
00:25:26,520 --> 00:25:30,080
Sorry, wait for me.

